ion is  of a white sport but South Africa is  looking more and more like a truly  multiracial squad do people there talk  about that  well they do and rugby is still White's  dominated but really as I said there was  a tremendous transformation that is  still ongoing but there's one person one  character who really shows the this  transformation and that is siiiick Oh  luli the captain of the team the first  black captain of the Springboks he's  such a strong role model for the kids  here he's somebody who stands for this  new South Africa not for the old one a  young generation is married to a white  woman but he doesn't even want to talk  much about this white black things  anymore he says we just have to look  forward and work together as a country  and I think this is a very powerful and  important message that this country  needs at this point of time  Adrian chrétien south edge of Africa  first thank you so so much
 

